~ quiz1
do GameDialogueManager.pause_game(true)
Odysseus: I’m detecting multiple Trojan Horses ahead, what should we do?
- Let them reveal themselves first before placing a tower.
	=>< wrong_ans1
- Allocate resources toward the other enemies, they are the most vulnerable.
	=>< wrong_ans1
- Distribute our defenses evenly across the battlefield to avoid creating weak points. 
	=>< wrong_ans1
- Deploy detection towers to reveal the Insider Threats, then eliminate them before they infiltrate our defenses.
	Odysseus: [[Good| Goodjob]].
	Player: I’m getting better at this!
	Odysseus: You are. => insider_threat
=> END

