~ insider_threat2
do GameDialogueManager.pause_game(true)
Odysseus: Insider threats can conceal themselves.  These are the users who misuse their authorized access— whether intentionally or accidentally.
Odysseus: They remain invisible until they get close enough to attack.
Player: That’s infiltration!
do GameDialogueManager.unlock_towers(7, "ai")
=> END

